{"id": "official:sentence:0da5aa86-563d-4928-8e2c-3c2e0250b30f", "text": "我去中国在两年前了。", "shortMeaning": "我两年前去的中国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:884ba4f6-56d5-4fbb-99b1-810fb3068bfe", "text": "我去买了泡芙，你要吃吗？", "shortMeaning": "我买了泡芙，你要吃吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1347a28-3c0e-49ee-8e85-e95f6293e95a", "text": "我去了机场送一个朋友。", "shortMeaning": "我去机场送了个朋友。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f1b75b2-dc7d-4d54-b7cf-5a3d20cdd990", "text": "我去参观了莎士比亚的故居。", "shortMeaning": "我参观了莎士比亚的故居。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b29edb3-90ec-4201-8293-39a3192257ae", "text": "我去听他的演讲去晚了。", "shortMeaning": "我听他演讲去晚了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ccbdc706-d448-418d-874a-51f0dc64f1e5", "text": "我去夏威夷休假了两周。", "shortMeaning": "我去夏威夷休了两周假。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4473c8e5-8161-4936-b9cf-16da77c8799a", "text": "我去布鲁塞尔比去巴黎去得频繁。", "shortMeaning": "我去布鲁塞尔比去巴黎更勤。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0aa1e8e0-b218-40a5-832a-33c6af4b3655", "text": "我去年大学毕业了。", "shortMeaning": "我去年从大学毕业了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff20e258-41cb-4160-b6b6-6b0c010d3362", "text": "我去看了一幅描绘了天国与地狱的画。", "shortMeaning": "我去看了一幅描绘天国与地狱的画。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02c20a03-2eea-4198-897f-52bf128d6558", "text": "我去车站为我朋友送行。", "shortMeaning": "我去车站为朋友送行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d2b89c3-918d-4b0f-8616-392688462960", "text": "我去过上海周围的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我去过上海周边的地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d1287ec-d050-48dd-9d02-3545308d0cd2", "text": "我去过天津两次而已。", "shortMeaning": "天津我只去过两次。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c19bb185-aec0-4a66-9fda-a37da48c91cf", "text": "我参加了一个游泳俱乐部。", "shortMeaning": "我加入了一个游泳俱乐部。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6c51ffaa-ebff-48e5-928a-9bf496c322b8", "text": "我又去爬了一次富士山。", "shortMeaning": "我又爬了一次富士山。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b0050f3-0f94-4a39-8d03-d0803cce6f44", "text": "我又失去了一次机会。", "shortMeaning": "我又错过了一次机会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:357bfb75-b95f-4f9c-a560-e44a38c6f87c", "text": "我又把它们混淆了！", "shortMeaning": "我又把它们搞混了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:96c50a1a-0bca-45ff-ba44-088cf7de6b58", "text": "我又报了德语课程。", "shortMeaning": "我又报名了德语课。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2a81690-6e31-48ba-b5de-1b5bba1d8f39", "text": "我发明了一款新桌游。", "shortMeaning": "我设计了一款新桌游。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e30d4e48-7520-45f6-bbde-ad6c57ec3d7c", "text": "我发现一个地方能买到便宜的水果。", "shortMeaning": "我发现一个能买到便宜水果的地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb0e9f56-6bfc-4d8a-b7ac-6971fc2d2030", "text": "我发现了他在化学方面的天赋。", "shortMeaning": "我发现他有化学天赋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:425821a6-1bc2-4845-99d0-511ac158945b", "text": "我发现他们正躺在人工草皮上。", "shortMeaning": "我发现他们正躺在人造草皮上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9e5bb84-fb3a-42ed-8a1a-f8132edbd207", "text": "我发现他在花园里干活。", "shortMeaning": "我看见他在花园里干活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8405db31-e9d3-49cf-a9a5-62d865c2d234", "text": "我发现你的语法错误少了很多。", "shortMeaning": "你的语法错误我见少了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5dbad865-bc2e-4411-ae76-b4f4857fe3d2", "text": "我发现有明确定义的词最容易记住。", "shortMeaning": "我发现定义明确的词最好记。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af8921e9-f537-4893-8d55-63f6f0fc3684", "text": "我发现读这本书很难。", "shortMeaning": "我觉得这本书很难读。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb443030-8f02-4420-b8db-baca0509ba42", "text": "我发现那个盒子是空的。", "shortMeaning": "我发现那盒子是空的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2524c4c-0418-4e26-8772-3d5bde9c68cc", "text": "我发现问题比我原以为的容易。", "shortMeaning": "我发现问题比原想的容易。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f460d50c-b2a4-4850-97c8-fc14c2b6648a", "text": "我发觉男孩儿酣然入睡了。", "shortMeaning": "我发觉男孩儿已经熟睡了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:432be86a-6236-470c-9a21-b49a69b05963", "text": "我发誓再也不和她说话了。", "shortMeaning": "我发誓不再跟她说话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1cd3e04f-53ba-4814-b743-cb807208ab31", "text": "我发誓我什么也没做。", "shortMeaning": "我发誓什么也没做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6d77d6e-473a-4a2b-b01d-ba291447891e", "text": "我发誓我看到了外星人。", "shortMeaning": "我发誓看到了外星人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7eb7ba9-7ea3-497f-b37d-f255107b79ce", "text": "我发誓，这次真不一样。", "shortMeaning": "我发誓这次真的不同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c12ae987-4067-444f-889e-513dd6fe5dd1", "text": "我叔叔住在西班牙的首都马德里。", "shortMeaning": "我叔叔住在西班牙首都马德里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9566ff8e-f65e-457a-aaf5-8aee6d7a72c5", "text": "我叔叔在巴黎住了十年。", "shortMeaning": "我叔叔在巴黎生活了十年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1f6e8f16-6e40-4a76-9dd3-2e9d63822724", "text": "我叔叔现在生活很安逸。", "shortMeaning": "我叔叔现在过得很安逸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b670c9e2-ba5e-431d-9c0b-702a810ce455", "text": "我叔叔的车跑地比我的快。", "shortMeaning": "我叔叔的车跑得比我的快。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af192d06-1473-4e11-82c0-255a76bd0080", "text": "我叔叔目前在香港。", "shortMeaning": "我叔叔现在在香港。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:03249372-8641-44a1-a72b-9393892ec931", "text": "我叔叔给了我一块漂亮的手表。", "shortMeaning": "叔叔送了我一块漂亮手表。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:766bb9be-2b93-4f69-94af-c966b213a29d", "text": "我叔叔说他每天早上慢跑。", "shortMeaning": "叔叔说他每天早晨慢跑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae85beb9-b5b5-4c4c-873b-3500747f49a1", "text": "我取得了众多可观的成就。", "shortMeaning": "我取得了许多可观的成就。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da962b87-b910-48a8-b904-c111b7e1f37d", "text": "我取得了非常可观的成就。", "shortMeaning": "我取得了很可观的成就。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91a0df77-55b7-49da-974b-cfd601532078", "text": "我受不了他的傲慢。", "shortMeaning": "他的傲慢让我受不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ed1c95e-d5fd-4b8d-974e-e7b7b7d7823f", "text": "我受不了他的无礼。", "shortMeaning": "他的无礼我受不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:acf287f0-7807-4687-8403-4c6ee2e09bb2", "text": "我受不了他那态度。", "shortMeaning": "他那种态度我受不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ceded7a2-313b-41ab-8638-a4405138668c", "text": "我受不了她没完没了的爱。", "shortMeaning": "她无休止的爱让我受不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42db8eae-b33d-4d32-b8cf-a6d048ac129e", "text": "我受不了淘气的小孩。", "shortMeaning": "我受不了淘气的孩子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3bf70025-33be-4604-8a69-fc83bae02d4c", "text": "我受不了这大热天了。", "shortMeaning": "这大热天我受不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:883def0b-5a39-424a-bec1-26339bb6e082", "text": "我受不了那种政治家。", "shortMeaning": "那种政客我受不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a250939-540e-4fe0-8ea9-cd350b3f96d0", "text": "我受够了你的反科学贫穷。", "shortMeaning": "我受够了你那反科学的穷酸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8d8c79c1-ee48-4415-8d5c-5566c80bfb61", "text": "我受够了单调的生活。", "shortMeaning": "我受够了乏味的生活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d49b96e-7d4a-44c6-b5f6-62582dd7a8c0", "text": "我只付了首期房款，余额是用按揭办法付的。", "shortMeaning": "我只付了首期房款，余额用按揭支付。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51e5496d-b6db-4964-b403-005e0e10c653", "text": "我只会说一点法语。", "shortMeaning": "我只会讲一点法语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69328c94-8661-4f8d-bc45-94df8aa27038", "text": "我只剩下一粒糖了。", "shortMeaning": "我只剩一颗糖了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ad681f5-5580-45b8-86cd-ecbb3aebc40e", "text": "我只吃自己种的蔬菜。", "shortMeaning": "我只吃自种的蔬菜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58176499-b54e-4c92-b108-bf1b78ca9c7a", "text": "我只告诉你，他有点蠢。", "shortMeaning": "我只跟你说，他有点傻。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55a4c862-f498-4553-8f40-24d0845dbed0", "text": "我只在这里待一天。", "shortMeaning": "我在这儿只待一天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9dbe2616-6fa4-41e4-9d85-4ccbf642b5d0", "text": "我只想向自己证明我可以做到。", "shortMeaning": "我只想向自己证明我办得到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2137ed0b-6431-4895-a18d-0fb20568909d", "text": "我只想和你在一起。", "shortMeaning": "我只想跟你在一起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24cb3254-6fa1-45b4-8138-ad8e059ab7ae", "text": "我只想弄清楚发生了什么。", "shortMeaning": "我只想弄明白发生了什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e9283227-9d53-414c-b056-aad32595d408", "text": "我只想查一下我的电子邮件。", "shortMeaning": "我只想查查电子邮件。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9382e5bc-2d59-4259-b698-1ce81369e678", "text": "我只想注意积极方面。", "shortMeaning": "我只想关注积极的一面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f706b886-02ae-4361-86ac-ac37363d6106", "text": "我只想简单办酒宴。", "shortMeaning": "我只想简单办个酒宴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2cda3d3c-c62d-498f-b020-4297136fcdad", "text": "我只想要一个明确的答案。", "shortMeaning": "我只要一个明确答复。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d2e6e5d-1096-4272-a5dc-a55b43737792", "text": "我只想要一些生菜。", "shortMeaning": "我只要点生菜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:10a1e287-4971-499b-a04f-d8526ed511dc", "text": "我只想要一件东西。", "shortMeaning": "我只要一样东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0af173ec-96bd-44ad-b989-c7a73dc93c5c", "text": "我只想要对你说“我爱你”。", "shortMeaning": "我只想对你说“我爱你”。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf9b7a4b-7d16-4009-8a34-77866ae2fa00", "text": "我只是不想失去你。", "shortMeaning": "我只是不愿失去你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f80037d4-032a-4bf8-983e-0b2cc813369a", "text": "我只是个普通人而已。", "shortMeaning": "我不过是个普通人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82e397e3-c734-4f01-b93a-40c8802b74e3", "text": "我只是听到了一些消息。", "shortMeaning": "我只是听到些风声。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5f72f621-b937-408a-8989-55d0771ba620", "text": "我只是在写一封信给我的女友。", "shortMeaning": "我只是在给女友写信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b4e64204-90fa-4fec-99b8-320b852732f3", "text": "我只是希望我们能离开这个可怕的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我只希望我们能离开这可怕的地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:73c9cad1-90cb-4bba-af1a-ab94ee22bb13", "text": "我只是待在家里看电视。", "shortMeaning": "我只是在家看电视。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:937e25d9-9947-4ebe-9f12-a09acbb6810d", "text": "我只是想写一些没有逗号的小句子。", "shortMeaning": "我只想写些没有逗号的短句。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bb9c532f-22c5-4e2b-96c2-b629f979e731", "text": "我只是想找个人说说话。", "shortMeaning": "我只是想找人聊聊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a7c8b68-a332-4efd-b780-9ff70cc27bb6", "text": "我只是想有个人来帮助我。", "shortMeaning": "我只是想有人帮我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b8a2ec7-0e4b-4f5d-a9d8-a3cfca89f1aa", "text": "我只是想看她而已。", "shortMeaning": "我只是想看看她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af40f421-1e70-4cfb-a79d-d454ca29f027", "text": "我只是想要你把我前些日子借给你的书还回来。", "shortMeaning": "我只是想让你把前些天借的书还回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eb7b18e9-5b71-4973-ab03-72fcbbfed37d", "text": "我只是想要听听你的嗓音。", "shortMeaning": "我只是想听听你的声音。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:511b9af4-46fc-43b3-8339-9f95ab1be691", "text": "我只是想跟她在一起而已。", "shortMeaning": "我只是想跟她在一起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e817ced-704d-44b8-bbe5-42db8622ca88", "text": "我只是来告诉你们事实的。", "shortMeaning": "我只是来告知你们事实。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1d20dc2a-4fad-4d60-9358-80c80e2c43bb", "text": "我只是照著你的指示。", "shortMeaning": "我只是照你的指示做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df1eae8d-993a-45e0-a8ea-c4ffe0f25856", "text": "我只是觉得这里用英语比较能表达我的想法。", "shortMeaning": "我觉得这里用英语更能表达想法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65577e90-e8d7-48af-910c-bde170d82054", "text": "我只是觉得，我说不过你。", "shortMeaning": "我只是觉得说不过你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a32154f-bfec-468b-9342-3e7d2c3e5aac", "text": "我只是跟你客气一下。", "shortMeaning": "我只是同你客气一番。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:430a0b25-e288-41e5-90b4-10ab61a4ce31", "text": "我只是随便谈谈自己不成熟的看法，无所谓有研究。", "shortMeaning": "我只是随便谈谈不成熟的看法，谈不上研究。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5838691b-3257-433f-8c88-29063c90641e", "text": "我只有十本英语教科书。", "shortMeaning": "我只有十本英文教科书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf592170-b524-4979-ae96-7d57cb9f5ed8", "text": "我只看见它变得更糟了。", "shortMeaning": "我只看到情况越来越糟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f92c5bb3-3697-4974-b4dc-4e43f6ea8e54", "text": "我只知道他的名字。", "shortMeaning": "我仅知道他的名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f7da32e8-b176-4a6b-b53e-3d661f9a9bbd", "text": "我只知道你一位加拿大人。", "shortMeaning": "我只知道你是个加拿大人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c4845b8b-fb8a-4517-baa6-4d306485a34c", "text": "我只知道我什么都不知道。", "shortMeaning": "我只知道我一无所知。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0ed7020a-ecf8-47ed-8978-47066e0226f4", "text": "我只知道那个绅士的名字。", "shortMeaning": "我只知道那位绅士的名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3adb5c63-6926-47f8-97ff-d936d71c7879", "text": "我只能在心里默默祈祷着不出岔子。", "shortMeaning": "我只能心里默默祈祷别出岔子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d45fa29a-a0d4-4cbb-96db-d45c5ab28ef0", "text": "我只能描述这可怕的味道像呕吐物混合着烂肉。", "shortMeaning": "这可怕的味道像呕吐物混着烂肉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:972749e6-f8e4-462f-8626-80572f97cec8", "text": "我只能走路，因为打不到出租车。", "shortMeaning": "打不到车，我只能走路。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b038dfa-9172-4c4f-ba28-83386d3f0f44", "text": "我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。", "shortMeaning": "我只能问自己这对别人是否也一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a75fc0cc-a5e1-44a4-aba8-091093712e6d", "text": "我只要告诉他就好了，他肯定会干得到。", "shortMeaning": "我只要告诉他，他肯定办得到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83e9ee33-bc09-47a1-b359-d06ec2f6a3f8", "text": "我只要求做这件事。", "shortMeaning": "我只要做这一件事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:150e8312-7286-46de-82c9-6df9c57b02c9", "text": "我只顾着爱她，却忘了爱自己。", "shortMeaning": "我只顾爱她，却忘了爱自己。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:508a3472-847a-479d-ab4a-2166584dc6f8", "text": "我叫人把我的自行车修好了。", "shortMeaning": "我让人把我的自行车修好了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d93218f2-36b4-4662-98f1-641b063bd957", "text": "我叫他不要太晚弹钢琴。", "shortMeaning": "我叫他别太晚弹钢琴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b552df0-ca9d-4919-9fe1-fe230972579b", "text": "我叫兰兰,我是中国人。", "shortMeaning": "我叫兰兰，是中国人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:362fc985-685a-4c43-8c2d-275ed7e77b5a", "text": "我叫她不要松开绳子，但是她做了。", "shortMeaning": "我叫她别松开绳子，可她还是松了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55d2935c-7138-4d62-b098-b7141ef3d5a3", "text": "我叫姜大虎。很大的「大」，老虎的「虎」。", "shortMeaning": "我叫姜大虎，是很大的“大”、老虎的“虎”。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27874c4e-dbab-40cf-8aa2-aae9841947df", "text": "我可不像你一样容易被打动。", "shortMeaning": "我可不像你那样容易被感动。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:63bb0a9b-6735-40ee-bf85-a7efd9e480a0", "text": "我可不可以吃这个苹果？", "shortMeaning": "我可以吃这个苹果吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:47d9b709-0ed7-418f-900c-35c012eb8840", "text": "我可不可以早上洗澡？", "shortMeaning": "我可以早上洗澡吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da3a4856-589d-4bad-b13a-28a6fc8a7fd3", "text": "我可不可以试一下这条裙子？", "shortMeaning": "我可以试一下这条裙子吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78fafad4-1f57-458f-a928-7f7079565a21", "text": "我可不想卷入这场纷争中去。", "shortMeaning": "我可不想卷入这场纷争。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2abd1f87-0f2c-4020-b012-d54e2d5f80c8", "text": "我可不想要坏事发生在我们身上。", "shortMeaning": "我可不想坏事落到我们头上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46707490-b86a-48fa-b8b9-83ade7dbdaa0", "text": "我可不敢吃你特制的汉堡。", "shortMeaning": "你特制的汉堡我可不敢吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:add57e3b-e534-4845-ab11-4f0867c81fa2", "text": "我可不能把阿渚交给这种文弱的男人。", "shortMeaning": "我不能把阿渚交给这种文弱的男人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:177080f9-eb87-42f3-ad73-2a41f0fbb422", "text": "我可什么都没说呢。", "shortMeaning": "我可什么也没说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12acbd26-068f-4b4c-a6ff-119f625f6afc", "text": "我可以为你调杯热饮料吗？", "shortMeaning": "我可以为你调杯热饮吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41c1be45-8ddc-4b38-90e6-c80de1f4fe33", "text": "我可以使用这支铅笔吗？", "shortMeaning": "我可以用这支铅笔吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d8db2db3-1f9e-4dfb-b7c3-3b417196da0f", "text": "我可以借一会你的书吗？", "shortMeaning": "我可以借一会儿你的书吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3caf466b-1961-4068-89fb-f1ecd9b80677", "text": "我可以借你的灰色西装吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能借你的灰西装吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:940e18c7-f3fa-4e18-afac-47879858e013", "text": "我可以借用您的眼线笔吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能借用您的眼线笔吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:15074b51-37be-4737-8b08-ec126bf08268", "text": "我可以做中英双向翻译，参加跟外国人交际谈判。", "shortMeaning": "我能做中英双向翻译，参加与外国人的谈判。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6306bbc5-1d46-4932-a18e-70796a5c9e88", "text": "我可以做什么来帮你呢？", "shortMeaning": "我能做什么来帮你呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41ac6c1b-610d-49f9-8fa3-f96f0a3a2b0c", "text": "我可以免费获取一份注册表格。", "shortMeaning": "我可以免费领一份注册表格。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14bbb221-19b7-4e6c-8bc4-66714fd3b216", "text": "我可以到哪里试穿？", "shortMeaning": "我能去哪儿试穿？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8aae3911-b3fa-43d6-b599-259a3256027c", "text": "我可以去冒这个险。", "shortMeaning": "我可以冒这个险。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:283c398f-a160-4b5c-bdd0-d64d449c0803", "text": "我可以去适应一下。", "shortMeaning": "我能去适应一下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81bb229e-d6a1-496a-b1d5-813fc7e4fdcf", "text": "我可以吃掉这个苹果吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能吃这个苹果吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d8733de-5c8b-4009-9dce-b9890c58878a", "text": "我可以听见你心里的声音。", "shortMeaning": "我能听见你心里的声音。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43f00add-7466-4c8d-8a2c-18b6537be913", "text": "我可以和你一起呆在这里吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能和你一起待在这里吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:767edea1-7764-4a8b-bb9f-24a7d657c408", "text": "我可以和你一起待在这儿吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能同你一起待在这儿吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b45a603-eefd-4a6f-906a-e11c92028907", "text": "我可以回答所有问题。", "shortMeaning": "我能回答所有问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bb74e3a3-031e-4f9d-b6c8-6dd60f9bcbb9", "text": "我可以在哪里买到戏票？", "shortMeaning": "我在哪里能买到戏票？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1683560-52e9-4540-a5e8-42830761be34", "text": "我可以在她眼中看到。", "shortMeaning": "我能从她眼里看出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee0c3ab0-f9d0-4031-8e27-4f86579ee089", "text": "我可以在这儿吸烟吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能在这儿抽烟吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6932b3a4-e790-49a4-b390-0d2ba09e1cde", "text": "我可以在这里办理登机手续吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能在这里办理登机手续吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6dc5f4db-e717-4962-acf2-ba45004f8c20", "text": "我可以在这里吸烟吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能在这里抽烟吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3a11189-3fa3-48df-92f4-534052def500", "text": "我可以尝试着做吗？", "shortMeaning": "我可以试着做吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41294531-be62-4e1c-afae-4aef8bffb790", "text": "我可以打扰你一下吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能打扰你一下吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d69463f-6238-45a7-82b2-eb38e42562fc", "text": "我可以把它放在这儿吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能把它放这儿吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a2478d35-c081-43d2-8ce8-5153cc4df318", "text": "我可以来点喝的吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能来点喝的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d992b237-9218-4fc6-82cf-11d9862939c6", "text": "我可以牵着你的手吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能牵你的手吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e9457c80-2ba7-4b31-ba28-dd43fcd33d4d", "text": "我可以用一下你的铅笔吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能用一下你的铅笔吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d5e53fe9-273a-4c59-a606-dd39762e5ffb", "text": "我可以用哪些信用卡？", "shortMeaning": "我能用哪些信用卡？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:473af4d8-6b80-40fe-a316-44439f5c23e8", "text": "我可以用支票付吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能用支票付款吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a99a45ba-f8db-4303-923b-70e5bdfc47cd", "text": "我可以用这部电话拨打外线电话吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能用这部电话打外线吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d25c44a-fe2c-4620-a8e5-4b8ca9306b40", "text": "我可以看下你的票吗？", "shortMeaning": "我可以看一下你的票吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:caceb1a8-c80f-4908-9f8e-5140f4979c5b", "text": "我可以给我的家庭提供衣食。", "shortMeaning": "我能给家人提供衣食。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:658c5d93-0844-4361-9743-3a01d7cf20e8", "text": "我可以要个纸袋吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能要个纸袋吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c56ec9a6-4a8a-4b22-b0bb-69d4c52b7b89", "text": "我可以触摸这个吗？", "shortMeaning": "我可以摸这个吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51954da4-cc86-4f9c-aadc-af1d5f7c3013", "text": "我可以试一下这双鞋吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能试一下这双鞋吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:512ce1ac-5183-4fa2-8950-113dd52c0bd4", "text": "我可以轻而易举地碰到我的脚趾。", "shortMeaning": "我能轻松碰到自己的脚趾。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22e9c7f0-51d1-448c-9cbc-5c0d2c3add8f", "text": "我可以问你个问题吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能问你个问题吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eabb71c9-91c5-4301-af8b-42a6567f499b", "text": "我可能会去那儿，但要看情况。", "shortMeaning": "我可能去那儿，但要看情况。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dfd0d241-c9bb-4fa7-8ab6-2b9799778ecc", "text": "我可能在什么时候看过这部电影，可我什么都想不起来了！", "shortMeaning": "我可能看过这部电影，却什么都想不起来了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c48a659-3052-4727-b02d-de573870ec35", "text": "我可能把钥匙忘了。", "shortMeaning": "我可能忘了带钥匙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7470a035-1333-48c3-8943-dab1f4099ccf", "text": "我可能是反社会的，但这并不表示我不跟人说话。", "shortMeaning": "我可能反社会，但不代表我不和人说话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5586b328-66ba-44f8-b084-8fb04ac6dee9", "text": "我可能有个好主意。", "shortMeaning": "我或许有个好点子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9154c0aa-127b-4eb5-a238-26f83749468d", "text": "我可能犯了个错误。", "shortMeaning": "我可能犯了错误。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae204b6b-dc8d-4f0a-97f9-a136f5a9957c", "text": "我可能知道你离开的日期吗？", "shortMeaning": "我能知道你离开的日期吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2142d65-5cad-43b0-ba23-b4ba36b9c9e1", "text": "我可能还要待几天。", "shortMeaning": "我可能还要再待几天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bef51d39-5e3b-4fff-945c-be6b8781f83f", "text": "我右鼻孔里有豌豆。", "shortMeaning": "我右鼻孔里有颗豌豆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01c8d3a1-560a-4c40-b7c2-bdcd79e946e6", "text": "我吃不起这么贵的餐馆。", "shortMeaning": "这么贵的餐馆我吃不起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ae95b53-8962-4949-9c91-9a4bf8796a6a", "text": "我吃两颗葡萄，剩下的留给你。", "shortMeaning": "我吃两颗葡萄，其余给你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4bfa08e2-7c55-4374-a864-99390cca9798", "text": "我吃了一个松花团子。", "shortMeaning": "我吃了个松花团子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d40e7399-1f78-4ad1-9ad5-9da900cd9289", "text": "我吃了一个汉堡，又叫了一个。", "shortMeaning": "我吃了一个汉堡，又点了一个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffc08c56-d273-41a2-8378-e0ea817baebb", "text": "我吃了一半三明治了。", "shortMeaning": "我吃了半个三明治。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6cff4d6-1130-4e1b-a2c4-add0869ce942", "text": "我吃了炒饭，也喝了啤酒。", "shortMeaning": "我吃了炒饭，还喝了啤酒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6cdc257-c050-4168-8262-e8841fb9a093", "text": "我吃了药，但完全没效果。", "shortMeaning": "我吃了药，但毫无效果。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3abd7433-4472-48b3-aa1a-d54854d7d781", "text": "我吃了黑芝麻冰淇淋。", "shortMeaning": "我吃了黑芝麻冰激凌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38f108a4-4f20-40f3-9b3d-f5e76bc36a99", "text": "我吃掉了一个汉堡，又点了一个。", "shortMeaning": "我吃光一个汉堡，又点了一个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d6520997-30e1-4361-b2cf-f4a752ecb854", "text": "我吃掉了我所有的橘子。", "shortMeaning": "我把橘子全吃光了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bb92bb62-68da-4ebc-9555-c9c81436cb76", "text": "我同他们没有过共同之处。", "shortMeaning": "我和他们没有共同点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b04f1c31-ed40-49fe-b4b6-481458e4930d", "text": "我同意你一部分的意见。", "shortMeaning": "我部分同意你的意见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7adf54fb-14f5-40e5-81c5-836f0409321d", "text": "我同意你站在我们这边。", "shortMeaning": "我赞成你站我们这边。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6f798083-532c-4f86-adf1-a33e8dc73c10", "text": "我同意帮助老太太。", "shortMeaning": "我答应帮那位老太太。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29a54e30-e893-4d28-a08c-52bd97d9066d", "text": "我后天以前必须要完成这个工作。", "shortMeaning": "我必须在后天前完成这项工作。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9cf08b18-e5cf-4c00-92ed-7d86d24720c7", "text": "我向他们解释了游戏规则。", "shortMeaning": "我给他们讲了游戏规则。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:36a513bb-0620-4c1e-9cc2-1d5f8dd05b79", "text": "我向他借了这本书。", "shortMeaning": "这本书是我向他借的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61ce6200-03e7-4a35-add9-305290a04822", "text": "我向他问了他的名字。", "shortMeaning": "我向他问了名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:889ff2c8-ebf2-456c-9752-5f2f300d0bb5", "text": "我向你们承诺——我们作为一个整体将会达成目标。", "shortMeaning": "我向你们承诺，我们会作为一个整体达成目标。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46eacf0a-63a9-4ca7-a212-943f7dc3dff3", "text": "我向天地神明发誓我的话绝无一丝虚假。", "shortMeaning": "我向天地神明发誓，我的话绝无虚假。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3658273-54ce-4cc8-863c-205bae257661", "text": "我向她问了她的地址。", "shortMeaning": "我向她问了地址。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3321ec51-a424-4551-b4db-b832ab7cebbb", "text": "我吓得说不出话来。", "shortMeaning": "我吓得说不出话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:938e500e-540d-4633-b806-a97b3d2e4fbb", "text": "我吞咽的时候喉咙痛。", "shortMeaning": "我吞咽时喉咙痛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:514af05a-d4d0-4031-ab1b-e280e07d80f1", "text": "我听不清那个男的在说些什么。", "shortMeaning": "我听不清那个男的在说什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ebfb135-948e-4558-bbf0-d57b1fd6973d", "text": "我听了，但什么也没听到。", "shortMeaning": "我听了却什么也没听见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14ac3690-dbf8-46b1-bf60-a59143037f8a", "text": "我听到一辆车停了下来。", "shortMeaning": "我听到一辆车停下了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e45dfe3-54e0-4078-9356-cd96fec93482", "text": "我听到了一个很有意思的谣言。", "shortMeaning": "我听到一个很有意思的谣言。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49be5d9b-8aba-47e6-bc38-9db6f7034caf", "text": "我听到房间里有声音。", "shortMeaning": "房间里我听到有声音。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24083da2-a05a-4ef8-a6fb-79a989bb57a0", "text": "我听到有人在唱歌。", "shortMeaning": "我听见有人唱歌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6a97167a-7b35-43cf-9fe1-0c50d2476150", "text": "我听到消息松了一口气。", "shortMeaning": "听到消息我松了一口气。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ff2acbf-45a4-4591-bd84-7e5cdd5d5bd9", "text": "我听到的就是这样。", "shortMeaning": "我听到的就是这些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34a7a060-30a6-4850-b8e2-1f8a61b75ea6", "text": "我听到窗外有人大叫。", "shortMeaning": "我听到窗外有人大喊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b40999c-ed80-4ec8-8688-d7969c8d6fdd", "text": "我听到这个消息很吃惊。", "shortMeaning": "听到这个消息我很吃惊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4509630f-9c91-4f13-9c83-cb8355162e71", "text": "我听到这个消息很惊讶。", "shortMeaning": "听到这个消息我很惊讶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6ce417c2-774e-4391-b378-1740393127a0", "text": "我听到这个消息时，简直不能相信自己的耳朵。", "shortMeaning": "听到这消息我简直不敢相信自己的耳朵。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:39e17bc3-13b2-4b08-ab46-ae9ce4f67e0b", "text": "我听到远处传来狗叫声。", "shortMeaning": "我听到远处传来狗叫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64f36d97-8a68-453f-af29-547f3a0786ef", "text": "我听够你的抱怨了。", "shortMeaning": "你的抱怨我听够了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:77c355a5-8b39-4f98-8a95-9f7484d643c8", "text": "我听够你的谎话了。", "shortMeaning": "你的谎话我听够了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:810f17e4-2042-4236-8bb5-ecaae3442fc9", "text": "我听她说英语说得流利。", "shortMeaning": "我听她说英语说得很流利。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2a1f7da-a554-42c1-a473-129d78dd05ec", "text": "我听得见你，但我看不见你。", "shortMeaning": "我听得见你，却看不见你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f9caf48d-65bc-40d2-9ab5-528d9e6c3d83", "text": "我听着收音机睡着了。", "shortMeaning": "我听收音机时睡着了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f598f6ef-2989-4f0f-a01c-609377b3085a", "text": "我听见男孩们唱歌。", "shortMeaning": "我听见男孩们在唱歌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
